OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fclear, dry and windy this evening with
OL,7,Fsome coastal gales in the north. Any
OL,8,Fspots of rain in the northeast during
OL,9,Fthe early evening will soon clear.
OL,10,FWinds will then ease through the night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FAnother wet and windy day as
OL,13,FStorm Boelo pushes in from the west.
OL,14,FWidespread heavy rain and strong
OL,15,Fwinds, these reaching gale force along
OL,16,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
