OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBrighter
OL,6,Fon Sunday with isolated showers and
OL,7,Fremaining windy until the evening.
OL,8,FRain will return on Monday morning,
OL,9,Fthen very strong winds, coastal gales
OL,10,Fand showers returning on Tuesday.
